      "content": "but it doesnt feel like im just struggling... it feels like i'm actually making things worse for them. like every time i struggle or cant pay for something or get sick, i'm just stealing from their future. they'd be so much better off if they didnt have to worry about me all the time. wouldnt it be easier for everyone if i just wasn't around to cause all this stress?",
